    "short_description": "Delhaize Belgium is a prominent food retail company based in Belgium, established in 1867. It began as a wholesale grocery business and became known for opening the country's first fully self-service supermarket in 1957. As a subsidiary of Ahold Delhaize, Delhaize operates over 800 stores across Belgium, employing around 15,000 people and serving millions of customers.\n\nThe company offers a wide range of products, including fresh produce, groceries, dairy, meat, and bakery items, with a strong focus on quality and sustainability. Delhaize also provides various shopping options, including physical supermarkets, convenience stores, and online grocery shopping through its website and mobile app. Customers can enjoy flexible delivery services and meal kits, enhancing their shopping experience. Delhaize Belgium is committed to local sourcing and sustainable practices, ensuring a positive impact on the community and the environment.",
